{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Tactics is a love letter to oldschool tactics rpgs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a motley band of heroes and fight through gauntlet of battles to save the land from evil. Level-up your party, unlocking new skills and classes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shrunk down for your\u00a0convenience~</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small Numbers: The units have roughly 2 to 5 health points. Your attacks will do 1 to 3 damage. All of the numbers are small enough to be easy to digest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro Tactics: Each battle is held in a tiny 6x8 battlefield, letting each combat resolve quickly without a lot of turns wasted on moving into position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Story: The campaign is composed of 5 to 8 chapters - you can probably play through the story in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remastered for Steam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We released this project over half a decade ago as our first debut rpg. Back then, it had a much simpler design, and was missing a lot of quality-of-life features. So it has been long overdue for a remaster! Most notably, we completely overhauled every level to support a wider screen resolution.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483150?t=1763766304","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483150?t=1763766304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483150/2fb58ffc7e94ad1b094d7c25cb78ab5f79082e7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763766304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483150/2fb58ffc7e94ad1b094d7c25cb78ab5f79082e7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763766304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Tactics is a love letter to oldschool tactics rpgs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a motley band of heroes and fight through gauntlet of battles to save the land from evil. Level-up your party, unlocking new skills and classes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shrunk down for your\u00a0convenience~</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small Numbers: The units have roughly 2 to 5 health points. Your attacks will do 1 to 3 damage. All of the numbers are small enough to be easy to digest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro Tactics: Each battle is held in a tiny 6x8 battlefield, letting each combat resolve quickly without a lot of turns wasted on moving into position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Story: The campaign is composed of 5 to 8 chapters - you can probably play through the story in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remastered for Steam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We released this project over half a decade ago as our first debut rpg. Back then, it had a much simpler design, and was missing a lot of quality-of-life features. So it has been long overdue for a remaster! Most notably, we completely overhauled every level to support a wider screen resolution.</p>","developers":["Goodberry Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483150/c46eac94aeb74d0fbd378a3e45f4e0b637c7b7b0/header.jpg?t=1763766304","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 12.4+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<